<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech o/n repo average yield hits 15.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Czech o/n repo average yield hits 15.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Average yield in a Czech National Bank (CNB) overnight repo operation on Friday to add liquidity to the crown market was 15.2 percent, the same as the minimum rate. Maximum yield was 15.21 percent.</p>
<p>In a similar tender on July 18, average yield was 16.3 percent.</p>
<p>-- Robin Shepherd, Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
